  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 05/06/2021). Our client Anand Sen is a 37-year-old government clerk who lives at House No. 145, Saibaba Colony, Coimbatore 641038 and can be reached on +91 83957 84757 or anand.sen75@example.com. The client's PAN YQKPS5306X.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Joseph Tiwari. A cheque for ₹22,40,000 issued by Joseph Tiwari bounced: the drawer stopped the cheque with a stop-payment instruction.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 222043820387 (IFSC KKBK0985367).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 251/2021 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Coimbatore on 16 October 2021.",
